C-LEDGER-READ-ABSENCE.Summary:
Give every ledger read path three exits (absent / unreadable / ok) instead of collapsing
no-file, parse failure, and missing wrapper into null (inherited Phase 5 conflation;
surfaced by Phase 10 corr 185). Spec only until planned and approved.

AcceptanceCriteria.AC-THREE-EXITS:
Ledger read distinguishes absent-no-file, unreadable (parse/mismatch), and ok. Discriminating
negatives: truncated file is unreadable not absent; missing file is absent not unreadable;
wrong wrapper id is unreadable with ledger.bundle-id-mismatch.
